Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 11:33:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(status): decode the RakNet pong message length

Read the unsigned message length before decoding Bedrock status fields. The encapsulation codec writes this prefix, and interpreting it as UTF-8 can inject a semicolon into the edition field and shift the MOTD, version, and player counts. Preserve empty trailing fields and reject truncated payloads.
